s 主動提出以 $20 億現金收購 SVC 旅館組合(93 間、逾 2.1 萬房),董事會將評估;盤後 +5.5%", "newsDetail": "> **今日漲因:** 10/9 盤後 **+5.5% 至 $7.54** — TKO Hotels 主動提出以 **$20 億現金**收購 SVC 的旅館組合,SVC 確認收到提案。\n\n**提案:** TKO Hotels(TKO LLC)10/9 透過 PR Newswire 宣布,提議以 **$20 億現金**收購 Service Properties Trust 的旅館投資組合。這是**未經邀約的提案(unsolicited)**,SVC 表示事前與 TKO 沒有接觸。\n\n**公司回應:** SVC 美東 18:45 發布新聞稿確認收到提案,董事會「將審慎檢視與考慮」,尚未做出任何決定、也沒有時程。截至 2026/6/30,SVC 擁有 **93 間旅館、逾 21,000 間客房**(美國含波多黎各及加拿大);提案是否涵蓋全部旅館,新聞稿未明說。\n\n**背景:** SVC 是 RMR 集團管理的 REIT,資產組合包括旅館與淨租賃零售物業,財務槓桿偏高;7 月初曾進行 1 股併 5 股反向分割,最新財報為 8/5 的 Q2。盤中 MT Newswires 已報導股價因 $20 億報價上漲。\n\n**注意:** 提案屬非約束性,董事會可能拒絕或要求更高價。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=SVC"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SVC"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-SVC/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-10-09T18:45:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "Business Wire — SVC confirms receipt of unsolicited proposal from TKO Hotels", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/real-estate/articles/properties-trust-confirms-receipt-unsolicited-224500358.html"}], "seanAnalysis": {"verdict": "PASS", "summary": "未經邀約的非約束性提案、董事會未表態,盤後量僅 17 萬,流動性撐不起當沖", "sourceDate": "2026-10-12"}, "milanAnalysis": {"score": 4, "summary": "主動提案、非約束性、只買旅館部分,董事會僅表示會檢視,實質性低", "sourceDate": "2026-10-12"}, "sessions": [{"last": 7.54, "chgPct": 5.45, "volume": 165721, "session": "post", "direction": "up", "name": "Service Properties Trust", "sessionDate": "2026-10-09", "targetDate": "2026-10-12"}], "primarySession": "post", "primaryDirection": "up", "last": 7.54, "chgPct": 5.45, "volume": 165721, "tv": {"latestEPS": -0.18, "consensusEPS": -0.19, "priorYrEPS": -1.15, "surpriseEPS_pct": 5.21, "surpriseEPS_dollar": 0.010000000000000009, "latestRev_M": 420.97, "consensusRev_M": 405.31, "priorYrRev_M": 503.44, "surpriseRev_pct": 3.86, "yrYrRev_pct": -16.38129667884951, "epsYoY_pct": 84.34782608695653, "epsEst_ne