indWave Innovations於9/24簽12個月技術服務合約，將與新加坡AQUAE Holdings合建AQUAEChain平台，消息帶動盤前一度大漲**25%**至**6.31美元**。\n\n**合約內容**\n\nApimeds Pharmaceuticals US（NYSE American: APUS）9月24日盤後宣布，子公司MindWave Innovations Inc.與新加坡AQUAE Holdings Pte. Ltd.簽署**12個月**技術服務合約，將MindChain區塊鏈架構部署為AQUAEChain平台核心，管理「已投保ALCI Credits」發行、驗證、追蹤、轉讓到註銷的完整生命週期，並提供上線後技術支援。\n\n**分潤條款**\n\n除軟體開發與技術服務費，MindWave每季末可依MindChain發行分類帳，分得AQUAEChain網路**已發行流通ALCI Credits總量的20%**。合約期滿後，雙方預計轉為**五年期**長期服務合作，惟仍須完成最終文件簽署。\n\n**公司背景**\n\nApimeds原以透明質酸填充劑等醫美產品為主業，此次透過MindWave跨入區塊鏈基礎建設，屬營運模式重大轉型；ALCI Credits定價與AQUAEChain上線時程尚未公開。APUS市值僅約**960萬美元**，籌碼相當淺碟。", "newsLinks": [{"label": "Finviz", "url": "https://finviz.com/quote.ashx?t=APUS"}, {"label": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APUS"}, {"label": "TradingView News", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/NASDAQ-APUS/news/"}], "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T16:05:00-04:00", "publishedTimezone": "ET", "sources": [{"label": "GlobeNewswire — MindWave Innovations Signs Agreement to Build and Operate AQUAEChain, a Platform for Insured ALCI Credits", "url": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/09/24/3368297/0/en/mindwave-innovations-signs-agreement-to-build-and-operate-aquaechain-a-platform-for-insured-alci-credits.html", "publishedAt": "2026-09-24"}, {"label": "StockTitan — MindWave signs 12-month AQUAEChain deal with AQUAE", "url": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/APUS/mind-wave-innovations-signs-agreement-to-build-and-operate-aquae-j4ffr0sbxa7y.html", "publishedAt": "2026-09-24"}, {"label": "InvestorWire — Apimeds Pharmaceuticals Subsidiary MindWave Signs 12-Month Technology Services Agreement with AQUAE Holdings", "url": "https://www.investorwire.com/investor-news-breaks/investornewsbreaks-apimeds-pharmaceuticals-us-inc-nyse-american-apus-subsidiary-mindwave-signs-12-month-technology-services-agreement-with-aquae-holdings/", "publishedAt": "2026-09-24"}], "seanAnalysis": null, "milanAnalysis": null, "sessions": [{"last": 6.11, "chgPct": 21.71, 